NOTICE

This work derives from the "sarg" package for pfSense software in
Unofficial-pfSense-packages:

    https://github.com/marcelloc/Unofficial-pfSense-packages

The original copyright notices are retained above as the license requires. Note
that this package was at one point part of pfSense itself -- hence the ESF, LLC
notice (Electric Sheep Fencing, the company behind pfSense before Netgate).

Changes made to the original:

  - An installer (install.sh) was added. It obtains the sarg binary from
    FreeBSD's official package repository rather than from a third-party pkg
    repository, and registers the package on pfSense 2.9.

  - Documentation (README.md, LEEME.md, docs/VERIFY.md) was added.

The package's own PHP and XML files are carried unmodified: they were verified
to run correctly on pfSense 2.9 with PHP 8.5.

Sarg itself is not distributed with this package. It is installed from
FreeBSD's package repository at install time and is licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2.
